            "text": "RTB · 2A DAILY INTEL · Monday, October 12, 2026",
            "spacing": "None"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "ATF has stopped requiring federal approval and registration for suppressors, short-barreled rifles and shotguns, and \"any other weapons,\" for everyone, nationwide.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "Effective Oct. 9, ATF no longer requires approval or registration for these four item types, applied to everyone, not just plaintiffs. Machine guns, state laws and SBR/SBS travel rules are unchanged, and the policy is reversible guidance, not law.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "color": "Warning",
            "text": "HOTTEST LEADS",
